{"3454620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Social Hook", "steam_appid": 3454620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎣 Social Hook</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Hook</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer game</strong> where the peaceful art of fishing meets the thrilling excitement of <strong>strategic monster card battles</strong>. Cast your line, reel in powerful cards, and challenge players in fast-paced duels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧍‍♂️ <strong>Character &amp; Outfit Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own fishing champion with unique outfits and accessories. Show off your style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/e5fe41208e8a8c212607c0598163d241.poster.avif?t=1786369201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/e5fe41208e8a8c212607c0598163d241.webm?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/e5fe41208e8a8c212607c0598163d241.mp4?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎣 <strong>Fishing Mini-Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch monster cards by playing an interactive fishing game. Choose the right bait and hook to increase your chances of success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/e62a4e843e804836496e9fdb72e33226.poster.avif?t=1786369201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/e62a4e843e804836496e9fdb72e33226.webm?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/e62a4e843e804836496e9fdb72e33226.mp4?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🃏 <strong>Catch &amp; Reveal Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster cards are discovered inside magical oysters. Watch the suspenseful reveal and surprise your friends with what you caught!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/1a06f03d32b139f2104b878d547ade25.poster.avif?t=1786369201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/1a06f03d32b139f2104b878d547ade25.webm?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/1a06f03d32b139f2104b878d547ade25.mp4?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧑‍🤝‍🧑 <strong>Multiplayer Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a room and play with or against friends. Whether you're fishing together or battling in cards, Social Hook is all about community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/aca654414f7a8c2b4fb8fe71e478cf83.poster.avif?t=1786369201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/aca654414f7a8c2b4fb8fe71e478cf83.webm?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/aca654414f7a8c2b4fb8fe71e478cf83.mp4?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 <strong>Text &amp; Voice Chat</strong><br> Coordinate your moves or just chat for fun. Make new friends while waiting for the next big catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏪 <strong>Fishing Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your gear to catch rarer cards! Purchase new rods, baits, and hooks to improve your chances of discovering legendary monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/e04b035325fae987a47d7c0f827fed1d.poster.avif?t=1786369201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/e04b035325fae987a47d7c0f827fed1d.webm?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/e04b035325fae987a47d7c0f827fed1d.mp4?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🪝 Bait &amp; Hook Selection Menu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare your fishing gear carefully before casting your line. Your choices directly affect which monsters you’ll encounter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌍 Discovery Menu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track your collection and see which monster cards you’ve discovered. Can you find them all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💰 Card Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your caught monster cards to earn in-game currency and fund even better fishing gear.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/9c3e64d989d5caeb0d3e93604d5aa3ea.poster.avif?t=1786369201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/9c3e64d989d5caeb0d3e93604d5aa3ea.webm?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/9c3e64d989d5caeb0d3e93604d5aa3ea.mp4?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧠 Single-Player Battles vs Bots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy card battles against AI opponents in solo mode. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/d690ef003d52a7cb8485cecbd5b52b99.poster.avif?t=1786369201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/d690ef003d52a7cb8485cecbd5b52b99.webm?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/d690ef003d52a7cb8485cecbd5b52b99.mp4?t=1786369201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐉 Over 300 Unique Monster Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each monster has its own unique powers — electricity, fire, water, and more! Build a deck that matches your strategy and outwit your opponents.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Hook blends cozy fishing vibes with competitive card game mechanics — perfect for players who love both adventure and tactical depth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎣 Social Hook</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Hook</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer game</strong> where the peaceful art of fishing meets the thrilling excitement of <strong>st